      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODEL FAMILY: Z-IMAGE TURBO\n\n**Compatible model examples / model location:**\ndiffusion_models/z_image_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors (official Comfy-Org int8). Z-Image finetunes from Civitai also load here.\n\n**Important:** CLIPLoader = `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors` with type **lumina2**; VAELoader = `ae.safetensors`; ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift 3; latent = EmptySD3LatentImage. Turbo: 8 steps, CFG 1, res_multistep / simple (the negative is unused at CFG 1). Natural-language prompts.\n\n**Ollama caption model vs image model:** In `Qwen3VLAbliteratedPromptPair`, `huihui_ai/qwen3-vl-abliterated:8b-instruct` is an **Ollama image-analysis model**, not your generation checkpoint.\n\n**ComfyUI limitation:** Standard dropdowns still list all matching file types from shared folders; this note and labeled loader indicate what is appropriate, but do not restrict dropdown contents."
      ],
      "title": "MODEL GUIDE \u2014 READ BEFORE SELECTING",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#161616"
    }
